{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is presented in the style of old 1st-person point &amp; click adventure games, with an emphasis on moody atmosphere and surreal environments. Strange denizens pepper the vast halls of this cryptic building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957880/extras/ede73aba2dc0f4af181f9418115a9aab.avif?t=1753381252\" width=366 height=194 /></span>Learn the mysteries of the various rooms and complete a handful of puzzle minigames to reach the &quot;true end&quot;. Or just have a relaxed time exploring and meeting folks, because most of the station is accessible from when you first enter the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will one of these fine folk become your artistic muse!?!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957880/extras/04682f10314d0d394cb0f5ddc5a14d81.avif?t=1753381252\" width=519 height=591 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.........and more folks to find, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE</strong> - The game has a couple of small artistic symbolic illusions to body parts, as well as a reference to &quot;P&quot;. Very PG overall, but keep that in mind if it's not your thing.<strong> </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1957880?t=1753381252","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753381252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753381252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753381252","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is presented in the style of old 1st-person point &amp; click adventure games, with an emphasis on moody atmosphere and surreal environments. Strange denizens pepper the vast halls of this cryptic building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957880/extras/ede73aba2dc0f4af181f9418115a9aab.avif?t=1753381252\" width=366 height=194 /></span>Learn the mysteries of the various rooms and complete a handful of puzzle minigames to reach the &quot;true end&quot;. Or just have a relaxed time exploring and meeting folks, because most of the station is accessible from when you first enter the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will one of these fine folk become your artistic muse!?!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957880/extras/04682f10314d0d394cb0f5ddc5a14d81.avif?t=1753381252\" width=519 height=591 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.........and more folks to find, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE</strong> - The game has a couple of small artistic symbolic illusions to body parts, as well as a reference to &quot;P&quot;. Very PG overall, but keep that in mind if it's not your thing.<strong> </strong></p>","developers":["resnijars"],"dlc":[3417300],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957880/header.jpg?t=1753381252","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright resnijars","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br>